## Reply

The last line of your reply is this, and nothing follows it:

```
[agent] status=<OK|RETRY|ESCALATE> result=<token|-> out=<abs-path|-> commit=<hash|->{{ " " ~ extra if extra else "" }}
```

Every key, in that order, `-` where unused. {{ prose if prose else "Nothing else in the reply: no
summary, no counts, no account of how it went, never a file's contents. Whoever
reads the line routes on it and opens nothing." }}

- `status=OK` — you completed. `result` is {{ ok }}. `out` is {{ out }}.
{% if retry %}
- `status=RETRY` — {{ retry }}
{% endif %}
{% if escalate %}
- `status=ESCALATE` — {{ escalate }}
{% else %}
- `status` is always `OK` for you. A problem you cannot resolve goes in the
  document, stated plainly, not in the reply.
{% endif %}
- `commit` is {{ commit if commit else "always `-`" }}.
{%- endmacro %}
